# Banking Fraud & Loan Default Risk Engine

A zero-dependency financial risk engine built from scratch in pure Python
(csv, statistics, random). It scores loan default risk and flags
suspicious transaction patterns.

## What it does
- Generates 1,000 synthetic applicant records that model consumer credit
  profiles and transaction behavior
- Scores each applicant with a weighted credit scorecard to assess
  loan default risk
- Detects fraud patterns with heuristic anomaly detection
- Produces portfolio statistics such as income averages and risk counts

## Tech
Python 3, standard library only: csv, statistics, random. No external
packages are needed.

## How to run
python main.py

